SUMMARY:Spontaneous Skate @ Wheels Durham 🛼
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nIf you’re looking for last minute 
 Friday night plans\, come out to adult skate night with me!\n\n🛼 From W
 heels Durham:\n\n“Start your weekend with a late-night session made for 
 the grown crowd”\n\nThe deets:\n\n* 18+ only\n* $13 admission\n* Skate r
 ental extra\n* Clear bag policy\n* Arrive as close to the skate session st
 art time as possible!\n\n**more info at [https://www.unitedskates.com/whee
 ls-durham/](https://www.unitedskates.com/wheels-durham/)
