SUMMARY:Dinner @ Maggiano's Little Italy
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\n**Saturday\, August 22\, 6:15pm - 8:
 15pm**\n\nJoin us for dinner at Maggiano's Little Italy\, where we will en
 joy good food and company!\n\n**Address:** 8030 Renaissance Pkwy.\, Durham
 \, North Carolina\, 27713\n\n**Menu:** [https://maggianos.com/menus/dinner
 /](https://maggianos.com/menus/dinner/)\n\nWe will meet at the entrance of
  the resturant at 6:10pm\nThe reservation will be under Richard Rabon.
