SUMMARY:Labor Day Potluck
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\n**Monday\, September 7\, 6:00-8:00pm
 **\n\nLet's have fun at a potluck! We will grill out\, play games\, and en
 joy delicious food.\n\nPlease sign up for the dish you would like to bring
  here: [Potluck Sign Up](https://grow.withlome.com/a/311e6a94-414c-4140-ba
 53-9f4a192565c0)\n**Please write in the message box what you are bringing.
 **\n\nI am covering the hamburgers\, but we need help with the rest. Pleas
 e let me know if you can bring any of the following:\n\n* Hamburger and ho
 tdog fixings (lettuce\, tomato\, onions\, etc.)\n* Hotdogs\n* Side dishes\
 n* Desserts\n* Plates and silverware\n* etc.\n\nThe event is BYOB\, so ple
 ase bring your own alcohol and a cooler. We will have the kitchen availabl
 e for food placement and storage. The party will be held both inside and o
 utside to keep everyone cool.\n\nWhat can you bring? :)
